            "notes": "Start with [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d). Use Biotic Orb as main heal this round, while tapping primary fire to put HOTs on teammates. Only use Biotic Orb offensively along with secondary fire in order to get picks. Keep in mind with your energy maxed you can get two extra hot/dps orbs out. Once at 50% and another at 0% with [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d). Burst heal/damage is possible in round one by using Biotic Orb right after [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) or procs.\n\n*Note* Use terrain to your advantage in order to get the most value from your orbs. Bouncing off walls and ceilings so they come back towards your/your team works wonders in the early rounds.",
